{
  "Arranges the fields of a data object on a grid. Each field gets an editor, chosen by name or by the type of its value, with two-way binding to the object. Groups, column spans and buttons organize the layout, and submitting the form validates every field first.": "",
  "Form bound to an object": "",
  "Editors by name: `text`, `password`, `email`, `textarea`, `number`, `date`, `datetime`, `time`, `checkbox`, `switch`, `dropdown`, `combobox`, `lookup`, `radio` and `slider`. If you omit the name, the value determines the editor: a number uses NumberBox, a boolean uses CheckBox, a Date uses DateBox, and anything else uses TextBox. `editorProps` are passed to the editor. Register custom editors once:": "",
  "The object the editors display and change.": "",
  "The form items. A function is tracked.": "",
  "The number of grid columns.": "",
  "As many columns as fit, each at least this wide.": "Sığdığı kadar sütun, her biri en az bu genişlikte.",
  "Passed to every editor.": "Her düzenleyiciye aktarılır.",
  "Makes every editor read-only.": "",
  "Occurs when the form is submitted and valid (`{ data, event }`) or submitted and invalid (`{ valid, invalid }`).": "",
  "FormItem": "FormItem",
  "The property, its label, its editor and the editor's props.": "",
  "Passed to the editor, each as a value or a function. `visible` hides the item.": "",
  "The number of columns it spans. Use `'all'` for the whole row.": "",
  "A labeled group with its own columns.": "",
  "Button props. `submit: true` submits the form.": "",
  "Any component created for this item.": "",
  "Validates every field, clears the results, and submits the form.": "",
  "The editor of a field.": "Bir field'ın düzenleyicisi.",
  "Your data object and items can be plain or reactive, and the form reads them as they are. After changing them in place, call `refresh()`. Every editor re-reads its value, items re-read their text and states, and added or removed items redraw the form.": "",
  "Re-reads one field of the data object after it has been changed in place.": "",
  "The validation group of the fields.": "",
  "The editors registered by name.": ""
